{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 54, :comments ["<b>Gamliel son of Pedahzur.</b> Our Sages of blessed memory said this, and this is their language: Gamliel — 'with me are recompensed good deeds'; son of Pedahzur — 'He ransomed me from prison.' End quote. And it further alludes in this manner to <b>Gamliel</b>: that Joseph said that HaShem recompensed him with good deeds on account of the matter, even though He ransomed him in that He showed him his likeness — and this is the saying <b>pedah zur</b> [rock of ransom]."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:06:41.855961229Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}